<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1133463369"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:54.747"><div begin="15.409" end="44.933" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.409" end="22.422" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.409" end="16.376">你只喜欢</span><span begin="16.376" end="17.210">我微</span><span begin="17.210" end="18.348">笑</span> <span begin="19.266" end="20.187">你决定我</span><span begin="20.187" end="21.158">的需</span><span begin="21.158" end="22.422">要</span></p><p begin="23.130" end="29.738" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.130" end="23.916">我要怎么</span><span begin="23.916" end="25.008">说才</span><span begin="25.008" end="25.923">好</span> <span begin="26.907" end="27.820">我不是为</span><span begin="27.820" end="28.800">你制</span><span begin="28.800" end="29.738">造</span></p><p begin="30.799" end="34.430" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.799" end="31.704">关心像是</span><span begin="31.704" end="32.621">泥沼</span> <span begin="32.621" end="33.556">拉着我往</span><span begin="33.556" end="34.430">下掉</span></p><p begin="34.627" end="38.110" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.627" end="35.514">爱是漂亮</span><span begin="35.514" end="36.391">口号</span> <span begin="36.450" end="37.323">透过你的</span><span begin="37.323" end="38.110">视角</span></p><p begin="38.428" end="44.933" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.428" end="39.302">你把我的</span><span begin="39.302" end="40.224">喜好</span> <span begin="40.239" end="42.056">随便删掉</span> <span begin="42.258" end="43.150">变成你要</span><span begin="43.150" end="44.103">的调</span><span begin="44.103" end="44.933">调</span></p></div><div begin="46.288" end="1:16.077" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.288" end="52.484" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.288" end="46.648">你</span><span begin="46.648" end="46.857">为</span><span begin="46.857" end="47.814">我好</span> <span begin="47.814" end="48.490">我</span><span begin="48.490" end="48.740">知</span><span begin="48.740" end="49.288">道</span> <span begin="49.288" end="49.708">我</span><span begin="49.708" end="50.403">都</span><span begin="50.403" end="50.626">知</span><span begin="50.626" end="52.484">道</span></p><p begin="53.854" end="1:00.726" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.854" end="54.287">我</span><span begin="54.287" end="54.442">的</span><span begin="54.442" end="55.448">烦恼</span> <span begin="55.448" end="56.197">我</span><span begin="56.197" end="56.406">的</span><span begin="56.406" end="57.386">骄傲</span> <span begin="57.386" end="59.257">你却不明</span><span begin="59.257" end="1:00.726">瞭</span></p><p begin="1:01.453" end="1:12.354" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.453" end="1:01.869">怎</span><span begin="1:01.869" end="1:02.146">样</span><span begin="1:02.146" end="1:03.693">爱你才</span><span begin="1:03.693" end="1:04.718">好</span> <span begin="1:04.986" end="1:05.238">毕</span><span begin="1:05.238" end="1:05.686">竟</span><span begin="1:05.686" end="1:06.374">黑豹</span> <span begin="1:06.374" end="1:08.901">需要自由奔</span><span begin="1:08.901" end="1:12.354">跑</span></p><p begin="1:12.398" end="1:16.077" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.398" end="1:13.185">不能满</span><span begin="1:13.185" end="1:14.120">足于</span><span begin="1:14.120" end="1:14.410">拥</span><span begin="1:14.410" end="1:16.077">抱</span></p></div><div begin="1:16.648" end="1:46.994" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:16.648" end="1:20.232" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.648" end="1:17.693">Can</span> <span begin="1:17.693" end="1:18.581">you</span> <span begin="1:18.581" end="1:19.119">feel</span> <span begin="1:19.119" end="1:19.577">my</span> <span begin="1:19.577" end="1:20.232">world</span></p><p begin="1:20.612" end="1:24.090" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.612" end="1:21.487">真实的我</span><span begin="1:21.487" end="1:23.466">没办法伪</span><span begin="1:23.466" end="1:24.090">造</span></p><p begin="1:24.357" end="1:28.102" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"